f 17592186276980 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186277007 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186277153 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186276799 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277821 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3f823688-c59b-5a64-9e51-9b7c368087e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186275562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186275817 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186276339 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186277517 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186277669 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186277517 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186277988 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "946d36e5-48fa-5671-b5c2-6b9df0953fbc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186277988 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1069 "q-160431" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1071 "For the transformation $T,$ defined as\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}{v}^{2}+uv \\\\ v-u\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\ncompute the value of the Jacobian determinant at the point where $[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "876a5d15-9cbd-5150-8246-c71dbabaa45c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278298 #edb/ref 1074 "Given a transformation \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we have $x(u,v)={v}^{2}+uv$ and $y(u,v)=v-u.$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =v & \\,\\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =2v+u \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =-1 & \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 2v+u \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =v\\cdot 1-(2v+u)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =v+2v+u \\\\  & =3v+u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, when $[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],$ the value of our Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n{\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|}_{(8,-2)}=3(-2)+8=2.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278597 #edb/ref 1080 "12\\,\\delta A" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278597 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278597 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "018385f7-7519-5922-8545-718d1e4443e3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278688 #edb/ref 1080 "6\\,\\delta A" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278688 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186278688 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "09f72da4-93f7-5f6e-8f5c-7adf97a2d87b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186279182 #edb/ref 1080 "16\\,\\delta A" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186279182 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186279182 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "42229dfb-92db-527f-98d4-81e464debdce" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186279238 #edb/ref 1080 "images/30/3033f0ae73e3f484fc5d3d65e388062feba1824fb3da997